  "verseCount": 20,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "23",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "GEN 23"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "23",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ogokwa gwa Sara, na Aburaamu okomotindeka",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 23:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sara nigo akoorete emiaka rigana erimo, na emerongo ebere, na etano na ebere (127); eye nero emiaka y’obogima bwa Sara.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.23.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 23:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sara agakwera ase Kiriati‐Ariba, agwo nao Heburoni, ase ense ya Kaanani. Aburaamu akagenda komoreera Sara na okweumia okonene, na akaroberia omoyega bw’ogotindekwa kwaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.23.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aburaamu akaimoka korwa ase egetondo kiaye, agateebia Abahiti,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.23.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 23:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Inche nomomenyi inde, imenyete ase egati yaino; komoranche mong’e aase ntindeke omokungu one onkwereire, imorusie ase obosio bwane.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.23.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 23:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abahiti bakairaneria Aburaamu, bakamoteebia,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.23.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 23:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Omonene, totegerere! Aye nigo ore omonto omonene o Nyasae ase egati yaito. Tindeka omokungu oo ase embeera ende yonsi engiya orachoore. Onde tari ase egati yaito orakorine embeera yaye gose agotange totindeka omokungu oo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.23.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aburaamu akaimoka, agatugama inse ase amasio ’Abahiti, abanto b’ense eria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.23.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ere agakwana nabarabwo, akabora: “Komoranche mong’e ribaga ntindeke omokungu one, imorusie ase obosio bwane, monyigwe na monsabere ase Efuroni, omwana o Sohari,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.23.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ang’e rikuruma riaye, erio rire agwo Makipela, ase ensinyo y’oboremo bwaye. Ase rigori riikeranu tiga ang’ere ase amasio aino, togoranereo, ribe aase aane ndabe ngotindeka abakuure.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.23.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bono Efuroni nigo areenge oikaransete agwo ase egati y’Abahiti. Ere Efuroni, Omohiti, akairaneria Aburaamu ekero Abahiti bonsi, abaare goetera egeita ki’omochie oye, bamotegererete,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.23.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "agateeba: “Yaya, omonene one, ntegerera. Oboremo boria nakoeire amo ne rikuruma riria rire imeo, ase amaiso ’abaanto baminto nakobieire; otindeke mokao aroro.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.23.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Aburaamu agatugama inse ase amasio ’abaanto b’ense eria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.23.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agateebia Efuroni ekero abanto b’ense eria bamotegererete: “Koranche, ntegerera! Inche nindue rigori ri’oboremo; naye obogorie chifeta korwa ase ’nde, na inche nintindeke mokane aroro.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.23.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Efuroni akairaneria Aburaamu,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.23.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akamoteebia: “Omonene one, ntegerera! Oboremo obwo bw’erigori rie chisekeli chi’efeta amagana ane, ngento ki toengereranie inche naye? Tindeka mokao agwo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.23.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aburaamu bagaancherana na Efuroni; na Aburaamu akarengera Efuroni chifeta chiria ateebete Abahiti kobaigwete, chisekeli chi’echifeta amagana ane, koreng’ana nekerengo giancheranire nabaonchoreria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.23.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oboremo bw’Efuroni obwo bware agwo Makipela moocha ya Mamure, oboremo amo ne rikuruma riria riare imeo na emete yonsi yareengeo, ensemo eria yonsi Aburaamu akayeegwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.23.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Igo ayeetwe ase amasio ’Abahiti, abwo bonsi baare gosoera egeita kiaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.23.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 23:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Magega y’ayio Aburaamu agatindeka Sara mokaye ase rikuruma ri’oboremo bware agwo Makipela, moocha ya Mamure, agwo nao Heburoni, ase ense ya Kaanani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.23.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.23.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 23:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabo oboremo boria, ne rikuruma riria riare imeo, Aburaamu akabinyora korwa ase Abahiti bibe aase kwaye agwo ase agotindeka abakuure.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.23.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
